# What the Recovery runs on, and nothing else: no editor, and no firmware but
# the wireless cards' - see the Recovery Partition in docs/REFERENCE.md. base
# brings what its tasks call beyond these: cryptsetup, fuser, file, bsdtar, the
# keymaps, and the network daemons iwd leans on.
arch-install-scripts
base
btrfs-progs
linux
mkinitcpio
mkinitcpio-archiso
plymouth

# A wireless network, joined from the menu when somebody asks for one. Nothing
# of it starts on its own - see network_up in oak.sh. The firmware is the
# wireless cards' of the default set, and pacman.conf leaves out what in those
# packages belongs to anything else.
iwd
wireless-regdb
linux-firmware-atheros
linux-firmware-broadcom
linux-firmware-intel
linux-firmware-mediatek
linux-firmware-realtek
